					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-261559#post-1568722</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-261559/running#post-1568722</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 19 Sep 2012 23:10:08 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>TL333s</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1304786</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>How did it came to this?</p> </blockquote> <p>How it this comed to be features?</p> <p>Not to snark, but I didn't find this compelling at all. The italicized parts help move things along but aren't always used well, nor is the choppiness of the sentences. The ending makes no sense at all and comes out of nowhere. Plus I have a serious distaste for second-person writing that isn't &quot;choose your own adventure&quot;.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
